// =============================================================================
// maintenance-trades-course — "Maintenance, Repairs and the Trades"
// =============================================================================
// Course five of the Real Estate department. DR-0500 established whose the
// ground is, DR-0501 what faithful management is measured by, DR-0504 how the
// transaction is done honestly, DR-0507 how the person on the other side is
// treated. This one covers the building itself -- what keeps it standing, who
// does that work, and the ways an owner quietly lets it go.
//
// THE ARC, one argument in eight moves:
//   1. By much slothfulness the building decayeth (Ecclesiastes 10:18, 10)
//   2. Called by name, and filled for the work (Exodus 31:2-5; 35:35)
//   3. Daubed with untempered morter (Ezekiel 13:10-11)
//   4. For they dealt faithfully (2 Kings 12:12, 15)
//   5. Stone made ready before it was brought (1 Kings 6:7)
//   6. Wages into a bag with holes (Haggai 1:4, 6, 9)
//   7. Where no oxen are, the crib is clean (Proverbs 14:4, 23)
//   8. The repairer of the breach (Isaiah 58:12, 7)
//
// Decay is the default rate -> the trades are a gifting Yahweh names -> never
// conceal a defect -> be the party trust is extended to, both directions ->
// finish the thinking before you arrive -> deferred is not saved -> the upkeep
// IS the increase -> and the name He gives the work. Lesson 8 is last because
// the seven before it are technique, and technique without it is ordinary asset
// management, which the world already teaches adequately.
//
// THE DEPARTMENT'S RECURRING SHAPE, named a fifth time: a wrong invisible from
// inside any single instance. The false weight, the lawful process that took
// Naboth's vineyard, attrition on a promise, the seating chart -- and now the
// daub, where each individual concealment is defensible and the practice is a
// lie told with a trowel. Lesson 3 also names the aggravating factor the other
// four did not have: a visible stain is an INSTRUMENT, so painting over it
// deletes the only gauge while the water keeps running.
//
// THE LINE THIS COURSE HOLDS (DR-0100). Deferred maintenance being a false
// economy is not a contested opinion to be staged as a debate; it is arithmetic,
// and lesson 6 states it plainly with the downstream channels named. What the
// course does NOT claim is that any specific repair is always worth its price --
// that is a real judgment call with real constraints, and lesson 7 gives the
// instrument (cost beside production, one page) rather than a slogan.
//
// NO PASSAGE IS SHARED with any of the department's other four courses, and the
// course test CHECKS that against their own reference lists rather than
// trusting it. Every book-and-chapter here is fresh ground: Ecclesiastes 10,
// Exodus 31, Exodus 35, Ezekiel 13, 2 Kings 12, 1 Kings 6, Haggai 1,
// Proverbs 14, Isaiah 58.
//
// AGE BANDS FROM THE FIRST COMMIT (DR-0497 / DR-0498): every lesson carries
// levels.teen and levels.senior, authored rather than re-registered.
//
// VERIFICATION (DR-0076 / SCRIPTURE-REFERENCE-STANDARD). All 79 quoted spans
// were fetched VERBATIM from the repository's own KJV and the generator refused
// to emit until every one matched -- clean on the FIRST run this time, which is
// the first course in the department where that was true. Our prose says
// Yahweh; quotations keep "the LORD" and "God" exactly as the KJV has them
// (DR-0210's bright line).
//
// TEACHING, NOT LEGAL OR TRADE ADVICE -- carried on the meta. Building codes,
// permit requirements, licensing, habitability standards and contractor
// liability are specific to your jurisdiction and they change; and nothing here
// makes anyone competent to perform work that requires a licensed trade.
// =============================================================================

