    anchor: { ref: 'Isaiah 58:12, 7', theme: 'Yahweh gives out a name for this work, and it is not a small one: "thou shalt be called, The repairer of the breach, The restorer of paths to dwell in." Notice what the same chapter attaches it to, because the title is not given for competence alone — it is given to people doing this: "Is it not to deal thy bread to the hungry, and that thou bring the poor that are cast out to thy house?" Repair and mercy are named in one breath, by Him, in one chapter.' },
